1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:02,960
Happy birthday, Run.

2
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:09,080
- Here, your birthday present.
- Oh? For me? That's so cute, thank you!

3
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:11,599
Thank you, Earth.

4
00:00:11,599 --> 00:00:17,687
- But P'Gun's paying, okay?
- Ugh, I can smell the love.

5
00:00:19,760 --> 00:00:28,000
- Can I flirt with you too?
- Hey, I'm joking—don't take it seriously.

6
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:34,754
Is he your brother or your boyfriend? The way you take care of him…
He's not my brother and not my boyfriend—he's someone I love.

7
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:43,039
- Still want to flirt with my brother?
- So… can I flirt with him?

8
00:00:43,039 --> 00:00:54,219
No, you can't.

9
00:00:56,920 --> 00:01:03,920
- Hey, we're going out after this. You coming?
- I've got a job interview.

10
00:01:03,920 --> 00:01:11,114
- A job interview? For what?
- I have an interview at a convenience store today.

11
00:01:12,463 --> 00:01:14,880
His damn family in debt or what?

12
00:01:14,880 --> 00:01:22,095
Yeah, suddenly he's working his ass off.
Dude, my family isn't in debt—*I* am.

13
00:01:22,833 --> 00:01:27,078
- Don't mess it up then.
- How the hell did you end up in debt?

14
00:01:27,078 --> 00:01:28,667
Just try to understand him, man.
